## What this predicate means

**A `created-with` B** — memorial A was authored *with* tool / model / software / mechanism B.  The tool-axis of the PAV (Provenance, Authoring, Versioning) creation triple — the distinctive PAV contribution that no FOAF / DC / PROV-O cognate cleanly supplies.  For AI-collaborative corpora, the tool axis is **load-bearing**: "created by Dan with Claude Opus 4.7" is structurally different from "created by Dan with Emacs" even when the human author is identical.  Closes the AI-collaboration tool-axis gap in conventional authoring vocabularies.

